// ============================================================
// function_name : set_quote_approval_level_wf (automation wrapper)
// purpose       : Lets a workflow rule run the standalone function
//                 standalone.set_quote_approval_level. A workflow rule cannot
//                 call a standalone function directly, so register this file as
//                 an automation function and attach it to the workflow rule on
//                 Quotes.
// argument      : quoteId (String) - the quote's record ID, passed from the workflow
//                 Note: this file holds only the function body. Add the declaration,
//                 including the argument quoteId, in the Zoho CRM function editor.
// related       : set_quote_approval_level.deluge (the function body that does the work)
// ============================================================
standalone.set_quote_approval_level(quoteId);
